    "21:_": "Baraita there",
    "22:א": "Mishnah there 120",
    "22:ב": "There, and like R' Shimon ben Nannas",
    "23:א": "Baraita there and the implication of several poskim",
    "23:ב": "Beit Yosef from the implication of the Tur",
    "24:א": "Rif, and likewise wrote the Maggid in chapter 12 in the name of Ra'avad and Ramban, and not like R' Yehuda there, and so appears the view of Rosh",
    "24:ב": "Tosafos there in the name of Rashbam, and likewise wrote the Tur",
    "24:ג": "Rambam in chapter 12 and the Maggid in the name of Rashba and Ran in the name of Ramban",
